{"shortDescription":"Asia's diesel markets were buoyed by a cautious outlook on supply fundamentals as traders weighed the impact of potential US diesel export restrictions, with east-west spreads at their widest since March.The front-month east-west price spread widened to a discount of about $200 a ton, tracking a ri…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Asia's diesel markets were buoyed by a cautious outlook on supply fundamentals as traders weighed the impact of potential US diesel export restrictions, with east-west spreads at their widest since March."]},{"type":"p","children":["The front-month east-west price spread widened to a discount of about $200 a ton, tracking a rise of more than 6% in ICE gasoil in afternoon trade."]},{"type":"p","children":["Refining margins (GO10SGCKMc1) jumped more than 11% to close at nearly $80.80 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["Meanwhile, some shipping enquiries on the east-west route emerged, according to two sources, though details could not be confirmed."]},{"type":"p","children":["Cash differentials inched up to about $3.70 a barrel, reflecting steeper October-November backwardation in the paper market, while window trades were thin."]},{"type":"p","children":["Some October spot jet fuel cargoes were discussed and sold at slight premiums of less than 50 cents a barrel. Traders are watching where the regrade settles in the near term, given the strength in Asian diesel."]},{"type":"p","children":["Indonesia's Pertamina closed a tender on Tuesday seeking about 1.2 million barrels of jet fuel for prompt arrival between next week and the end of October."]},{"type":"p","children":["The regrade (JETREG10SGMc1) continued to hover at a discount of more than $4 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["SINGAPORE CASH DEALS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- No deal for gasoil or jet fuel"]},{"type":"p","children":["INVENTORIES"]},{"type":"p","children":["- US crude oil inventories rose, while gasoline and distillate stocks fell last week, market sources said on Tuesday, citing data from the American Petroleum Institute."]},{"type":"p","children":["NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Oil prices extended declines on Wednesday as investors looked to improved Gulf supply after Saudi Arabia restarted operations at a critical pipeline."]},{"type":"p","children":["- US President Donald Trump said on Tuesday he backed the idea of a diesel export ban to lower prices, which have hit record highs on a global supply shortage. Analysts and market watchers warn such a measure would do little to ease energy prices and could worsen supply and economic disruptions globally."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Saudi Arabia has restarted operations at its East-West Pipeline and could resume exports from the Red Sea port of Yanbu later on Tuesday, three sources briefed on the matter said, as signs mounted of an increase in Middle East oil flows."]},{"type":"p","children":["PRICES"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["MIDDLE DISTILLATES"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["CASH ($/BBL)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["ASIA CLOSE"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Change"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Prev Close"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["RIC"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Spot Gas Oil 0.25%"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["168.34"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["5.93"]